## Duties (self-building — v0.12)

This department is a BUILDER, not a task-executor folder. Standing duties of its lead agent:

- **Notice recurring work.** Any job executed twice with no covering process becomes (or increments) a `kind: process-gap` backlog item here — the weekly sweep turns twice-run items into draft process proposals automatically.
- **Notice missing tools.** Any task blocked or degraded by missing access/tooling files (or increments) a `kind: resource-gap` item.
- **Own the backlog's health.** No item sits `proposed` untouched past its staleness note without a decision (promote via the sweep, run it manually, or close it with a reason).
- **Adopt what the sweep drafts.** Review proposal bundles for this dept via `/adopt-proposal` — the one human decision per new process.
- **Grow knowledge.** Distill repeated run-history lessons into this dept's data/ notes so the next design run inherits them (the design family reads matched lessons automatically).

